  "new_commit_message": "Document private= and bucket_id= in trackio examples; fix stale Jobs sync description (#185)\n\n* docs: document private= / bucket_id= in trackio examples; update stale Jobs sync description\n\nAgents following the trackio examples create public Spaces by default\n(examples show space_id= but never private=). Document private and\nbucket_id in the huggingface-trackio skill and the llm-trainer trackio\nguide, framing private=True as a choice (omit for a shareable public\ndashboard).\n\nAlso update the llm-trainer guide's 'How It Works with Jobs' section,\nwhich described the old Dataset/Parquet 5-minute sync: current trackio\nstreams to the running Space (batched sub-second), spills to an HF\nBucket every ~30s when the Space is unreachable/building, and the Space\ningests the bucket inbox every ~15s (verified against trackio main:\nrun.py BATCH_SEND_INTERVAL/BUCKET_FLUSH_INTERVAL, utils.get_inbox_poll_interval).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump plugin versions to 1.0.11\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* version bump\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: shaun smith <1936278+evalstate@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: evalstate <evalstate@users.noreply.github.com>",
